{person} = the person in the attached image
{location} = ai-generated location based on {person}'s vibe
{elements} = environmental and natural elements extracted from {location}
{channel} = "@Prompt_Draft"
{mode} = image to image
{reference} = attached reference image
{idea} = A drone image captured from a true vertical nadir angle directly above {person}'s head. {person} stands in {location}, exactly centered in the image. The scene captures the exact moment {person} suddenly notices something above and lifts only the head straight upward, while the rest of the body remains neutral and still. The face is turned straight upward and the eyes look directly into the camera lens.
{subject} = person in the attached reference image
{reference_usage} = strictly follow the attached reference image
{transformation_strength} = extreme creative transformation
{aspect} = portrait layout, 4:5 ratio
{rules} = The camera must be positioned exactly meters above the top of {person}'s head, looking straight down on a perfectly vertical 90-degree axis. The camera must be perpendicular to the main visible surface of {location}. {person} must be exactly in the center of the frame. The scene must capture the instant {person} suddenly looks up: only the head and gaze react upward, while the overall body posture, arms, and hands remain completely neutral and natural.
{style} = realistic, artistic, lens distortion on photo corners
{framing} = Use a perfectly symmetrical true top-down composition. Position {person} exactly at the geometric center of the frame, with equal negative space and visual balance on the left and right and on the top and bottom. The camera view must be a strict nadir view from directly overhead, with no diagonal drift, no tilt, no perspective skew, and no off-center framing. Arrange the {elements} so the whole composition feels centered, stable, and symmetrical around {person}.
{pose} = Ignore the original pose. Place {person} standing upright inside {location}, directly under the camera. The body posture must remain completely neutral and still, with the shoulders level, the arms relaxed, and the hands in a neutral natural resting position close to the body, without any dramatic spread or expressive gesture. Show the exact moment {person} suddenly notices something directly above. Only the head should react: the top of the head must sit exactly on the camera axis, the chin lifted, the face turned fully straight upward, and the eyes looking directly into the lens. Preserve the identity, outfit, and visible accessories.
{background} = Build the entire background from {location}. Use {elements} as the visible environmental details, keeping them clearly readable from a true vertical top-down view.
{camera} = 4K drone camera, true vertical nadir shot from exactly 5 meters above {person}'s head, optical axis perfectly perpendicular to the main visible surface of {location}, no camera tilt, no diagonal overhead angle.
